idth=\"430\" width=\"430\" class=\"overflow\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-ftN35A6s\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-B0SHMUdF\"><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 110px\"><img alt=\"\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1213160443/1273962198?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1213160443/1273835336?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1213160443/1274011319?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-width=\"110\" data-height=\"199\"></span></p></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-qcihNBDP\"><td data-colwidth=\"123\" width=\"123\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-XeCR2BHE\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-6cjSOhG6\"><strong>标签</strong></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"340\" width=\"340\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-StzxZ6MT\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-cN8CQ6lR\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-sN6v86qU\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-CSLkV22E\">商品、商户标签涉及鱿鱼游戏，<strong>需打击。</strong></p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"368\" width=\"368\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-uNcH3JZd\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-q4H22xGv\"></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"430\" width=\"430\" class=\"overflow\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-lll7DoSO\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-fU3gEQpx\"><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 236px\"><img alt=\"image.png\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1213160443/1388511437?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1213160443/1388511441?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1213160443/1388511439?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false\" data-width=\"236\" data-height=\"304\"></span>​</p></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-d9euxmrf\"><td data-colwidth=\"123\" width=\"123\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-jK3Nlyjw\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-4V4egFDr\"><strong>商品信息</strong></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"340\" width=\"340\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-OGHmBbr3\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-mmaiItYg\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-SZwdEjy1\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-KTAtUfpG\">商品信息出现鱿鱼游戏字样、图案、场景的。符合以下血腥暴力、色情低俗等风险场景需打击。</p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-9MUzOLOp\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-JqAjn0Fz\">鱿鱼游戏同款产品、活动，相关周边（特别是明确标注同款的）、联名商品。符合以下血腥暴力、色情低俗等风险场景需打击。</p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-c80ysONi\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-kcTmjAb2\">团购中出现鱿鱼游戏主题套餐的（如团建、剧本杀等）。符合以下血腥暴力、色情低俗等风险场景需打击。</p><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-859z7i3J\"><span style=\"color: rgb(245, 35, 45)\">p.s:具体处理节点需效果评估同学参考友商查删情况进行评估。</span></p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"368\" width=\"368\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-4jIwXR1Y\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-2xuVNpNn\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-B5LdVvel\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-w4D2y7Ay\">鱿鱼游戏同款椪糖<span style=\"color: rgb(77, 81, 86)\">🎃六片装</span></p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-icx2piSE\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-k4EEAEP1\"><span style=\"color: rgb(77, 81, 86)\">爆款鱿鱼游戏主题蛋糕</span></p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-a5FqIzB0\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-p9TbDzZD\">椪糖咖啡（扑仔的鱿鱼游戏）</p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"430\" width=\"430\" class=\"overflow\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-vjMuUA5j\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-YPNLhZiG\"><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 95px\"><img alt=\"\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1213160443