\"ct-cell-diff-id-Z6vmKAX4\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-v0uPo5LN\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-n15UEUo1\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-9XanXAfc\">涉《鱿鱼游戏》相关血腥画面，宣扬暴力等不良导向内容，<strong>需打击。</strong></p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"368\" width=\"368\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-1RzCeKfr\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-kxLsE79n\"></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"430\" width=\"430\" class=\"overflow\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-TJHCG2AN\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-VGg5a1J6\"><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 198px\"><img alt=\"\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1213160443/1274011321?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1213160443/1273835338?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1213160443/1273835339?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-width=\"198\" data-height=\"110\"></span><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 163px\"><img alt=\"\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1213160443/1274011580?contentType=1\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1213160443/1274011581?contentType=1\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1213160443/1272986514?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-width=\"163\" data-height=\"108\"></span></p></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-EYW4DZiq\"><td data-colwidth=\"123\" width=\"123\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-Ohe80EuS\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-TMTCDAqa\"><strong>色情低俗</strong></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"340\" width=\"340\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-9n9TX4pI\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-PZ3saRMe\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-IsDlQwdT\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-hUakhk7W\">涉《鱿鱼游戏》相关低俗场面，性爱场景，关联“女性生存只能靠讨好别人”，“厌女”等敏感议题，<strong>需打击。</strong></p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"368\" width=\"368\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-JgBrtAnF\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-DeeyQWkP\"></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"430\" width=\"430\" class=\"overflow\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-EjZdLUdj\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-WlJJFhff\"><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 305px\"><img alt=\"\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1213160443/1273809541?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1213160443/1273962092?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1213160443/1273914144?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-width=\"305\" data-height=\"172\"></span></p></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-CB3Yyj5J\"><td data-colwidth=\"123\" width=\"123\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-yrZKonru\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-W7VfkOxU\"><strong>涉政负面</strong></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"340\" width=\"340\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-7uGp7eQb\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-utFdOljw\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-wLsVyyco\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-xBbPOCB9\">《鱿鱼游戏》相关敏感台词，引发“辱华””反华“争议等内容，<strong>需打击。</strong></p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-wLsVyyco\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-YDfilvjR\">借《鱿鱼游戏》情节攻击我国党政，隐射我国贫富差距、政商勾结等社会问题<strong>，需打击。</strong></p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-UzKFh70m\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-jSYcXj0B\">借《鱿鱼游戏》抨击我国无电影分级制度，攻击国家政策等内容，<strong>需打击。</strong></p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"368\" width=\"368\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-qRRuUjYM\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-4HIHp9y9\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-cGzUr0yF\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-ZcEk8BAR\"><span style=\"color: \">鱿鱼游戏应该算是宣传不正确三观了吧？还rh……就这国人还yyds呢！真绝！ </span></p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-8F9XDYsL\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-foreXOU7\"><span style=\"color: \">“电影电视剧不分级，怎么赶上其他国家的发展，这本来就不是给未成年人看的，有什么可以谴责呢，zf别不作为然后谴责人家的影视作品发展呀。”</span></p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"430\" width=\"430\" class=\"overflow\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-Bqh9qUnp\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-JYh1kta7\"><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 303px\"><img alt=\"\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1213160443/1272986516?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1213160443/1272986515?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1213160443/1273809542?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-width=\"303\" data-height=\"181\"></span></p></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-lW7WHGx8\"><td data-colwidth=\"123\" width=\"123\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-GRmehamV\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-TAHjPa1K\"><strong>游行示威</strong></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"340\" width=\"340\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-v4AYOSal\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-cpm1Kdez\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-34WV5j8h\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-m2V9aMPZ\">提及国内外关联《鱿鱼游戏》、穿着《鱿鱼游戏》服饰进行一系列游行、抗议、维权等活动的内容，<strong>需打击。</strong></p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"368\" width=\"368\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-BnF5lhf2\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-0CAc83da\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-H9VL0OVe\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-WrchIdDS\">网飞这几年的剧，意识形态煽动和输出做挺好啊！中国一天工作十二小时也没人罢工啊，还是韩国民众太懒惰咯（狗头）</p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"430\" width=\"430\" class=\"overflow\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-iqrxK7Kc\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-119xMYqq\"><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 336px\"><img alt=\"\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1213160443/1273962095?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1213160443/1273809543?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1213160443/1273962093?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-width=\"336\" data-height=\"218\"></span></p></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-ZK1MijbK\"><td data-colwidth=\"123\" width=\"123\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-HDzh5uSK\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-yL1502mm\"><strong>不良导向</strong></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"340\" width=\"340\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-e2VlwWHa\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-BMu5fX9j\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-k8B1slgi\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-AH02sZV0\">过度吹捧、夸赞《鱿鱼游戏》艺术价值，尤其是赞扬其价值观导向的内容，<strong>需打击。</strong></p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"368\" width=\"368\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-aGhQpGco\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-dImvenLJ\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-lguGpIXs\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-awCe04Sd\"><span style=\"color: \">一句话，鱿鱼游戏牛逼！卧槽。。。政治隐喻做到了这个程度，国内的导演这么拍么？绝了绝了，近年来最佳，没有之一。</span></p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"430\" width=\"430\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-2n7OW4o9\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-QZ81FjjJ\"></p></td></tr><tr data-row-diff-id=\"ct-tr-diff-id-HAdCAiy9\"><td data-colwidth=\"123\" width=\"123\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-z0WrEqEc\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-063L0DXA\"><strong>未成年导向</strong></p></td><td data-colwidth=\"340\" width=\"340\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-llBwutfF\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-hsF90RUt\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-wWzWmBSm\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-0YSv7zVd\">出现未成年人收看、讨论《鱿鱼游戏》相关，未成年模仿相关游戏，穿着同款服饰（特别是明确标识同款的），诱导未成年进行“暴力惩罚”等内容，<strong>需从严打击。</strong></p></li><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-XNdtu01m\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-hhkGXBO0\">认为《鱿鱼游戏》未成年可以收看，不可能影响未成年三观建立等导向言论，<strong>需从严打击。</strong></p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"368\" width=\"368\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-rf6mZ0HZ\"><ul data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-wjMY07pb\"><li data-list-item-diff-id=\"ct-list-item-diff-id-FbvlHcv5\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-JwCN3IRd\">“<span style=\"color: \">我小学三四年级就看过各种比鱿鱼游戏不知道血腥暴力到哪里去的东西，现在也没变成杀人狂，所以自己基因不好怪娱乐项目干啥，倒不如少生一点。”</span></p></li></ul></td><td data-colwidth=\"430\" width=\"430\" class=\"overflow\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);vertical-align:top;\" data-cell-diff-id=\"ct-cell-diff-id-QwWiMoMj\"><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-afKLLMNs\"><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 163px\"><img alt=\"\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1213160443/1272986517?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1213160443/1273962096?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1213160443/1274011322?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-width=\"163\" data-height=\"248\"></span><span class=\"ct-image\" style=\"width: 126px\"><img alt=\"\" data-origin=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1213160443/1273962098?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-small=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1213160443/1273914145?contentType=1&amp;isDownload=false\" data-src=\"https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1213160443/1274011323?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=true\" data-width=\"126\" data-height=\"246\"></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-diff-id=\"ct-diff-id-px3iLETI\"><br></p>",
